          "settings": {
            "heading": "VIP ACCESS: NOW LIVE & SHIPPING",
            "text": "<p>We have a feeling you're just as excited as we are for summer golf. So we loaded all our future summer drops onto a private plane just to get them here in time for VIP's to #EnjoyTheWalk all summer. <\/p><p>- <\/p><p><strong>Introducing The Summer 2023 Collection<\/strong><\/p><p>Limited Quantities Available<\/p>",
